From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:13:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] AP MLD: Free the partner link stations of a BSS that is torn down

hostapd_free_stas() frees the stations of a BSS. For a non-AP MLD whose
association link is that BSS, ap_free_sta() clears the state machine of
the partner link stations but leaves those stations on the partner
links, where they stay without a state machine. This happens when the
BSS is deinitialised, on EVENT_INTERFACE_DISABLED, on a configuration
reload of the BSS, and on DEAUTHENTICATE or DISASSOCIATE with
ff:ff:ff:ff:ff:ff on the control interface.

Free the partner link stations together with the stations of the BSS.
When the whole AP MLD goes down, the first link frees the partner link
stations that the later links would free with their own BSS.

Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Signed-off-by: ViKing <viking.yfy@qq.com>

--- a/src/ap/sta_info.c
+++ b/src/ap/sta_info.c
@@ -637,6 +637,10 @@
 void hostapd_free_stas(struct hostapd_data *hapd)
 {
 	struct sta_info *sta, *prev;
+
+#ifdef CONFIG_IEEE80211BE
+	hostapd_free_mld_partner_stas(hapd);
+#endif /* CONFIG_IEEE80211BE */
 
 	sta = hapd->sta_list;
 
@@ -2157,6 +2161,22 @@
 		}
 	}
 }
+
+
+/* ap_free_sta() of the station on the association link clears the state
+ * machine of its partner link stations and leaves them on their links. */
+void hostapd_free_mld_partner_stas(struct hostapd_data *hapd)
+{
+	struct sta_info *sta;
+
+	for (sta = hapd->sta_list; sta; sta = sta->next) {
+		if (!ap_sta_is_mld(hapd, sta) ||
+		    sta->mld_assoc_link_id != hapd->mld_link_id)
+			continue;
+
+		ap_sta_remove_link_sta(hapd, sta);
+	}
+}
 #endif /* CONFIG_IEEE80211BE */
 
 
--- a/src/ap/sta_info.h
+++ b/src/ap/sta_info.h
@@ -494,6 +494,7 @@
 void ap_sta_free_ml_kem_data(struct eap_over_auth_data *auth_data);
 
 void hostapd_free_link_stas(struct hostapd_data *hapd);
+void hostapd_free_mld_partner_stas(struct hostapd_data *hapd);
 void set_wpa_sm_for_each_partner_link(struct hostapd_data *hapd,
 				      struct sta_info *psta, void *wpa_sm);
 void clear_wpa_sm_for_each_partner_link(struct hostapd_data *hapd,
